{%- comment -%}
  THE GRIND — a skate shop inside The Yoink. v1.

  INDEPENDENT, NOT NEARBY. The argument is not "buy local to you" — a customer in
  Mesa is not closer to any of these shops than to a warehouse. It is that the
  money goes to an independent skate shop rather than to a distributor. Copy on
  this page should never imply proximity, because that promise would be false
  for almost every reader.

  THE STORY IS THE SHOPS, AND THERE IS NO DEAL HERE. Every other surface on this
  store sells on price — one thing a day, deeply discounted, gone in 24 hours.
  This one does not, and pushing a discount on it would bury the only thing that
  makes it worth existing: the boards come from real independent shops, and
  buying here still pays them. So the shops sit directly under the hero, ahead
  of the categories, with names and towns rather than a line in a paragraph.

  Until those are filled in the band renders nothing, which is the honest state:
  a page naming no shops should not imply any.

  THE ERA WITHOUT THE MARKS. Tony Hawk, THPS, Powell Peralta and Element are all
  live trademarks and this is a commercial page. What is free is the GRAMMAR of
  1999 skate media: griptape black, a video-game HUD, warped display type, spray
  stencils, VHS grain. The six categories are laid out as selectable levels
  because that is the device everyone remembers, and it costs nothing to borrow.

  IT DEGRADES TO NOTHING GRACEFULLY. Products come from Collective suppliers who
  are not onboarded yet, so every product row checks its collection first and
  the category tiles link out whether or not a collection exists behind them.
  A v1 that only renders when the catalogue is finished is a v1 nobody can look
  at.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign s = section.settings
-%}

<div class="aj-grind" style="{% render 'spacing-style', settings: section.settings %}">

  {%- comment -%} ---- hero ---- {%- endcomment -%}
  <div class="aj-grind__hero">
    <div class="aj-grind__tape" aria-hidden="true"></div>

    <div class="page-width aj-grind__hero-inner">
      <p class="aj-grind__kicker">{{ s.kicker | escape }}</p>
      <h1 class="aj-grind__title">{{ s.heading | escape }}</h1>
      {%- if s.subheading != blank -%}
        <p class="aj-grind__sub">{{ s.subheading | escape }}</p>
      {%- endif -%}

      {%- comment -%}
        THE HUD. A score counter is the one piece of 90s skate furniture that
        can carry real information — so it does: what the shop is, not a number
        invented to look busy.
      {%- endcomment -%}
      <ul class="aj-grind__hud" role="list">
        <li><span class="aj-grind__hud-k">Shops</span><span class="aj-grind__hud-v">{{ s.hud_shops | escape }}</span></li>
        <li><span class="aj-grind__hud-k">Orders</span><span class="aj-grind__hud-v">{{ s.hud_deal | escape }}</span></li>
        <li><span class="aj-grind__hud-k">Shipping</span><span class="aj-grind__hud-v">{{ s.hud_ships | escape }}</span></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>

  {%- comment -%}
    ---- the shops ----
    Blocks rather than fixed settings: the number of shops is the one thing
    guaranteed to change, and a shop added is a block added rather than an edit
    to this file.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- if section.blocks.size > 0 -%}
    <div class="aj-grind__shops-band">
      <div class="page-width aj-grind__section">
        <p class="aj-grind__eyebrow aj-grind__eyebrow--on-dark">{{ s.shops_eyebrow | escape }}</p>
        <h2 class="aj-grind__h2 aj-grind__h2--on-dark">{{ s.shops_heading | escape }}</h2>
        {%- if s.shops_body != blank -%}
          <p class="aj-grind__shops-body">{{ s.shops_body | escape }}</p>
        {%- endif -%}

        <ul class="aj-grind__shops" role="list">
          {%- for block in section.blocks -%}
            <li class="aj-grind__shop" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
              <span class="aj-grind__shop-name">{{ block.settings.name | escape }}</span>
              {%- if block.settings.town != blank -%}
                <span class="aj-grind__shop-town">{{ block.settings.town | escape }}</span>
              {%- endif -%}
              {%- if block.settings.line != blank -%}
                <span class="aj-grind__shop-line">{{ block.settings.line | escape }}</span>
              {%- endif -%}
            </li>
          {%- endfor -%}
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  {%- endif -%}

  {%- comment -%} ---- the six categories, as levels ---- {%- endcomment -%}
  <div class="page-width aj-grind__section">
    <p class="aj-grind__eyebrow">{{ s.cats_eyebrow | escape }}</p>
    <h2 class="aj-grind__h2">{{ s.cats_heading | escape }}</h2>

    <ul class="aj-grind__levels" role="list">
      {%- for i in (1..6) -%}
        {%- liquid
          assign nkey = 'cat_' | append: i | append: '_name'
          assign hkey = 'cat_' | append: i | append: '_handle'
          assign bkey = 'cat_' | append: i | append: '_blurb'
          assign name = s[nkey]
          assign handle = s[hkey]
          assign blurb = s[bkey]
        -%}
        {%- if name != blank -%}
          <li class="aj-grind__level">
            <a href="{% if handle != blank %}{{ routes.all_products_collection_url | replace: '/collections/all', '/collections/' | append: handle }}{% else %}#{% endif %}">
              <span class="aj-grind__level-no">{{ forloop.index | prepend: '0' | slice: -2, 2 }}</span>
              <span class="aj-grind__level-name">{{ name | escape }}</span>
              {%- if blurb != blank -%}<span class="aj-grind__level-blurb">{{ blurb | escape }}</span>{%- endif -%}
              <span class="aj-grind__level-go">Drop in &rarr;</span>
            </a>
          </li>
        {%- endif -%}
      {%- endfor -%}
    </ul>
  </div>

  {%- comment -%}
    ---- a product row, only when there is something in it ----
    Same rule the merch shelf follows: a shelf advertising an empty collection
    is worse than one fewer row.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- liquid
    assign featured = collections[s.featured_handle]
  -%}
  {%- if featured != blank and featured.products.size > 0 -%}
    <div class="page-width aj-grind__section">
      <p class="aj-grind__eyebrow">{{ s.featured_eyebrow | escape }}</p>
      <h2 class="aj-grind__h2">{{ s.featured_heading | escape }}</h2>
      <ul class="aj-grind__grid" role="list">
        {%- for product in featured.products limit: 4 -%}
          {%- assign v = product.selected_or_first_available_variant -%}
          <li class="aj-grind__card">
            <a href="{{ product.url }}">
              <span class="aj-grind__shot">
                {%- if product.featured_image -%}
                  <img src="{{ product.featured_image | image_url: width: 600 }}"
                       alt="{{ product.featured_image.alt | escape }}"
                       width="300" height="300" loading="lazy">
                {%- endif -%}
              </span>
              <span class="aj-grind__card-name">{{ product.title | escape }}</span>
              <span class="aj-grind__card-price">{{ v.price | money }}</span>
            </a>
          </li>
        {%- endfor -%}
      </ul>
    </div>
  {%- endif -%}

  <div class="page-width aj-grind__section aj-grind__foot">
    <p class="aj-grind__foot-line">{{ s.foot_line | escape }}</p>
    {%- if s.cta_text != blank and s.cta_link != blank -%}
      <a class="aj-grind__cta" href="{{ s.cta_link }}">{{ s.cta_text | escape }}</a>
    {%- endif -%}
  </div>
</div>

{% stylesheet %}
  /*
    GRIPTAPE IS THE GROUND. The whole page sits on near-black with a grit
    texture, which is the one surface every skater has looked at for hours. The
    brand's purple and yellow ride on top of it rather than under it — this is
    the only Yoink surface that is not built on white or purple, and it should
    feel like a different room in the same building.
  */
  /*
    NO `section` CLASS ON THE ROOT, and this is the second time this codebase has
    paid for the lesson. Adding it to pick up the theme's width handling let the
    theme win `background` on that element — the black ground vanished, `color:
    #fff` still applied, and the page shipped white on white with only the
    purple text-shadow visible. `aj-join` carries the same warning from 7 Aug.

    Background and text colour stay together on a class this file owns and
    nothing else targets, and the gutter is handled below rather than borrowed.
  */
  .aj-grind {
    background: #0f0f11;
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  /*
    THE SECTION OWNS ITS OWN GUTTER. `.page-width` computed to max-width: none
    and zero padding inside this template — the theme's rule keys off a chain
    this page does not reproduce, so content sat flush against both viewport
    edges at 1920 and would have touched the text on a phone. Constraining it
    here means the page cannot depend on where it is mounted, which is the whole
    point of a landing page that will move.
  */
  .aj-grind .page-width {
    max-width: var(--page-width, 87.5rem);
    margin-inline: auto;
    padding-inline: clamp(1.25rem, 5vw, 3.5rem);
  }

  .aj-grind__hero { position: relative; padding: clamp(3rem, 9vw, 6rem) 0 clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.5rem); overflow: hidden; }

  /* The grit: two offset dot fields, which reads as griptape and costs nothing
     to ship. A photograph of grip would be a 400KB texture doing the same job. */
  .aj-grind__tape {
    position: absolute; inset: 0; pointer-events: none; opacity: 0.55;
    background-image:
      radial-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,0.10) 1px, transparent 1px),
      radial-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,0.07) 1px, transparent 1px);
    background-size: 5px 5px, 7px 7px;
    background-position: 0 0, 3px 4px;
  }

  .aj-grind__hero-inner { position: relative; }

  .aj-grind__kicker {
    font-family: "Ohpixel", var(--font-heading--family);
    text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    font-size: clamp(0.75rem, 1.6vw, 0.9rem);
    color: var(--aj-brand-yellow, #ffe000);
    margin: 0 0 0.9rem;
  }

  .aj-grind__title {
    font-family: "Flashy", var(--font-heading--family);
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: clamp(3.5rem, 13vw, 9rem);
    line-height: 0.88;
    margin: 0;
    color: #fff;
    /* A hard offset shadow in brand purple: the cheapest way to make display
       type read as a sticker rather than as a heading. */
    text-shadow: 0.06em 0.06em 0 var(--aj-brand-purple, #7a3fa0);
  }

  .aj-grind__sub {
    margin: 1.4rem 0 0; max-width: 46ch;
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 2.4vw, 1.25rem); line-height: 1.45;
    color: rgb(255 255 255 / 0.86);
  }

  /* ---- the HUD ---- */
  .aj-grind__hud {
    display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.75rem;
    margin: 2rem 0 0; padding: 0; list-style: none;
  }
  .aj-grind__hud li {
    display: grid; gap: 0.15rem;
    padding: 0.6rem 1rem;
    background: rgb(255 255 255 / 0.06);
    border: 1px solid rgb(255 255 255 / 0.14);
    border-radius: 4px;
  }
  .aj-grind__hud-k {
    font-family: "Ohpixel", monospace; text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em; font-size: 0.7rem; color: var(--aj-brand-cyan, #5cd8f8);
  }
  .aj-grind__hud-v { font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.95rem; }

  /* ---- sections ---- */
  .aj-grind__section { padding: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 4rem) 0; }

  .aj-grind__eyebrow {
    font-family: "Ohpixel", var(--font-heading--family);
    text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    font-size: 0.8125rem; color: var(--aj-brand-cyan, #5cd8f8);
    margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
  }
  .aj-grind__eyebrow--on-dark { color: var(--aj-brand-yellow, #ffe000); }

  .aj-grind__h2 {
    font-family: "Flashy", var(--font-heading--family);
    font-weight: 400; font-size: clamp(2rem, 5.5vw, 3.25rem);
    line-height: 1; margin: 0 0 1.6rem; color: #fff;
  }

  /* ---- the levels ---- */
  .aj-grind__levels {
    display: grid; gap: 0.9rem; margin: 0; padding: 0; list-style: none;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
  }
  @media screen and (min-width: 750px) {
    .aj-grind__levels { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); }
  }

  .aj-grind__level a {
    display: grid; gap: 0.35rem; height: 100%;
    padding: 1.25rem 1.25rem 1.1rem;
    background: #17171b;
    border: 1px solid rgb(255 255 255 / 0.12);
    border-left: 4px solid var(--aj-brand-yellow, #ffe000);
    border-radius: 6px;
    text-decoration: none; color: #fff;
    transition: transform 0.12s ease, background 0.12s ease;
  }
  .aj-grind__level a:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); background: #1e1e24; }

  .aj-grind__level-no {
    font-family: "Ohpixel", monospace; font-size: 0.75rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em; color: rgb(255 255 255 / 0.45);
  }
  .aj-grind__level-name {
    font-family: "Flashy", var(--font-heading--family);
    font-weight: 400; font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 4vw, 2.1rem); line-height: 1;
  }
  .aj-grind__level-blurb { font-size: 0.95rem; color: rgb(255 255 255 / 0.7); line-height: 1.4; }
  .aj-grind__level-go {
    margin-top: auto; padding-top: 0.5rem;
    font-family: "Ohpixel", monospace; text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em; font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--aj-brand-yellow, #ffe000);
  }

  /* ---- the shops ---- */
  .aj-grind__shops-band { background: var(--aj-brand-purple, #7a3fa0); }
  .aj-grind__shops-body { margin: 0 0 1.6rem; max-width: 52ch; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(255 255 255 / 0.92); }

  .aj-grind__shops { display: grid; gap: 0.9rem; margin: 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; }
  @media screen and (min-width: 750px) {
    .aj-grind__shops { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); }
  }
  .aj-grind__shop {
    display: grid; gap: 0.25rem;
    padding: 1.1rem 1.2rem;
    background: rgb(0 0 0 / 0.25);
    border: 1px dashed rgb(255 255 255 / 0.35);
    border-radius: 6px;
  }
  .aj-grind__shop-name { font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.1rem; }
  .aj-grind__shop-town {
    font-family: "Ohpixel", monospace; text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em; font-size: 0.72rem; color: var(--aj-brand-yellow, #ffe000);
  }
  .aj-grind__shop-line { font-size: 0.95rem; color: rgb(255 255 255 / 0.85); line-height: 1.4; }

  /* ---- featured products ---- */
  .aj-grind__grid { display: grid; gap: 1rem; margin: 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
  @media screen and (min-width: 750px) {
    .aj-grind__grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); }
  }
  .aj-grind__card a { display: grid; gap: 0.4rem; text-decoration: none; color: #fff; }
  .aj-grind__shot {
    display: block; aspect-ratio: 1 / 1; overflow: hidden;
    border-radius: 6px; background: #1a1a1f;
  }
  .aj-grind__shot img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; display: block; }
  .aj-grind__card-name { font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.3; }
  .aj-grind__card-price {
    font-family: "Flashy", var(--font-heading--family);
    font-size: 1.25rem; color: var(--aj-brand-yellow, #ffe000);
  }

  /* ---- foot ---- */
  .aj-grind__foot { text-align: center; }
  .aj-grind__foot-line {
    font-family: "Flashy", var(--font-heading--family);
    font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 2.25rem); line-height: 1.1;
    margin: 0 0 1.4rem; color: #fff;
  }
  .aj-grind__cta {
    display: inline-block; padding: 0.95rem 1.8rem;
    background: var(--aj-brand-yellow, #ffe000);
    color: var(--aj-brand-ink, #282828);
    border-radius: 6px; font-weight: 800; text-decoration: none;
  }
  .aj-grind__cta:hover { filter: brightness(1.06); }
{% endstylesheet %}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "AJ The Grind",
  "tag": "section",
  "settings": [
    { "type": "header", "content": "Hero" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "kicker", "label": "Kicker", "default": "A skate shop inside The Yoink" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "heading", "label": "Heading", "default": "The Grind" },
    { "type": "textarea", "id": "subheading", "label": "Subheading",
      "default": "Decks, trucks and hardware from independent skate shops — and a bit of our own. Same gear, same shops, one checkout." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "hud_shops", "label": "HUD — shops", "default": "Independent, not chains" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "hud_deal", "label": "HUD — second stat", "default": "Every order goes back" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "hud_ships", "label": "HUD — third stat", "default": "Ships from the shop" },

    { "type": "header", "content": "Categories" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "cats_eyebrow", "label": "Eyebrow", "default": "Pick your line" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "cats_heading", "label": "Heading", "default": "Six ways in" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "cat_1_name", "label": "1 name", "default": "Decks" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "cat_1_handle", "label": "1 collection handle", "default": "grind-decks" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "cat_1_blurb", "label": "1 blurb", "default": "Blanks, pros and shop boards." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "cat_2_name", "label": "2 name", "default": "Trucks" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "cat_2_handle", "label": "2 collection handle", "default": "grind-trucks" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "cat_2_blurb", "label": "2 blurb", "default": "The bit that actually grinds." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "cat_3_name", "label": "3 name", "default": "Hardware" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "cat_3_handle", "label": "3 collection handle", "default": "grind-hardware" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "cat_3_blurb", "label": "3 blurb", "default": "Bearings, bolts, bushings, wheels." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "cat_4_name", "label": "4 name", "default": "Safety" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "cat_4_handle", "label": "4 collection handle", "default": "grind-safety" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "cat_4_blurb", "label": "4 blurb", "default": "Helmets and pads. No lecture." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "cat_5_name", "label": "5 name", "default": "Completes" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "cat_5_handle", "label": "5 collection handle", "default": "grind-completes" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "cat_5_blurb", "label": "5 blurb", "default": "Built and ready to roll away on." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "cat_6_name", "label": "6 name", "default": "Apparel" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "cat_6_handle", "label": "6 collection handle", "default": "grind-apparel" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "cat_6_blurb", "label": "6 blurb", "default": "Shop tees, ours and theirs." },

    { "type": "header", "content": "The shops" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "shops_eyebrow", "label": "Eyebrow", "default": "Who you are buying from" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "shops_heading", "label": "Heading", "default": "The shops" },
    { "type": "textarea", "id": "shops_body", "label": "Body",
      "default": "Skate shops are independent, outnumbered and closing. These are the ones stocking this page — buying here buys from them instead of from a warehouse that has never stood on a board." },

    { "type": "header", "content": "Featured row" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "featured_eyebrow", "label": "Eyebrow", "default": "On the shelf" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "featured_heading", "label": "Heading", "default": "In the shop now" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "featured_handle", "label": "Collection handle",
      "info": "Renders nothing until this collection has products, so the page is safe to ship before the suppliers are onboarded.",
      "default": "grind" },

    { "type": "header", "content": "Foot" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "foot_line", "label": "Line", "default": "Same deck. Bought from a skate shop instead of a warehouse." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "cta_text", "label": "Button", "default": "Meet the shops" },
    { "type": "url", "id": "cta_link", "label": "Button link" },

    { "type": "header", "content": "Spacing" },
    { "type": "range", "id": "padding-block-start", "label": "Top padding", "min": 0, "max": 100, "step": 4, "unit": "px", "default": 0 },
    { "type": "range", "id": "padding-block-end", "label": "Bottom padding", "min": 0, "max": 100, "step": 4, "unit": "px", "default": 0 }
  ],
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "shop",
      "name": "Skate shop",
      "settings": [
        { "type": "text", "id": "name", "label": "Shop name", "default": "Shop name" },
        { "type": "text", "id": "town", "label": "Where the shop is", "info": "Flavour, not a proximity claim — nobody is buying because it is near them.", "default": "Town, ST" },
        { "type": "text", "id": "line", "label": "One line", "default": "What makes this shop worth knowing about." }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "presets": [{ "name": "AJ The Grind" }]
}
{% endschema %}
